# C8 reduced TS at TIGHT convergence: OptTS + Freq in one job, TightOpt.
#
# Same seed and same active-region freeze as ../optts_freq/, but with `TightOpt`.
# The default OptTS tolerance leaves the gradients near 1e-4 Eh/bohr, and on a
# frozen-host partial Hessian the floppy low modes are hypersensitive to that
# residual: ../optts_freq/ and the two-job ../optts_numfreq/ agree to 0.03 kJ/mol
# on E yet to ~30 kJ/mol on G, entirely through the ZPE (lowest real modes 137
# cm-1 against 49 cm-1). TightOpt tightens the ORCA default about three-fold
# (TolRMSG 1.0e-4 -> 3.0e-5, TolMAXG 3.0e-4 -> 1.0e-4 Eh/bohr), so the
# stationary point, and the Hessian read off it, are better defined.
#
# MaxIter raised because the tighter criterion needs more cycles on a floppy
# 17-active-atom region.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) OptTS Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{61 64 120 121 122 124 125 126 128 129 130 131 132 133 134 135 136}
END
ActiveAtoms
	{61 64 120 121 122 124 125 126 128 129 130 131 132 133 134 135 136}
END
ExtendActiveRegion no
Charge_total 0
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 400
  Calc_Hess true
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
